flowchart TD
    A[Brain MRI Image] --> B[Preprocessing]
    B --> B1[Resize to 224x224]
    B --> B2[Normalize using ImageNet statistics]
    B --> B3[Training-only augmentation]

    B --> C{Model Benchmark}
    C --> C1[Custom CNN]
    C --> C2[ResNet50]
    C --> C3[EfficientNet-B0]
    C --> C4[DenseNet121]

    C1 --> D[Validation: Macro F1]
    C2 --> D
    C3 --> D
    C4 --> D

    D --> E[Best Model]
    E --> F[Raw Logits]
    F --> G[Temperature Scaling]
    G --> H[Calibrated Class Probabilities]

    H --> I[Predicted Class]
    H --> J[Validation-derived Confidence Threshold]
    J --> K{Confidence >= threshold?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Accepted Prediction]
    K -->|No| M[Uncertain - Expert Review]

    E --> N[Grad-CAM]
    N --> O[Visual Explanation / Tumor-relevant Region]

    I --> P[Final Output]
    L --> P
    M --> P
    O --> P
